Fanpage Connect is the WordPress plugin that allows you to create an manage your Facebook fan pages directly from WordPress.

== Description ==

Fanpage Connect is a robust plugin that allows you to create and publish professional looking Facebook Fan Pages from the convenience of your Wordpress website.

*"This plugin is slick!! I was able to customize just the way I like and do it fast! Oh, and you’re support is amazing.*
**- Michele L**

= What do you get with Fanpage Connect? =

* Easy to launch, customizable Fan Pages from the comfort of Wordpress Editor platform.
* Increased visitor conversion through the use of fan gates.
* Style your content with the use of Google Fonts that are built into the plugin.
* Wordpress widget capabilities to use on your Fan Page Tabs.
* Use one of several themes that are available to you or just go freestyle.
* The ability to publish fan page tabs that are more enticing to your visitors.
* Easily add your new tab to your fan page with a simple "Add to Facebook" button.
* Create high converting fan pages by easily creating a "Fan Gate" to get your visitors to "like" the page to see more content.
* Use WordPress Custom Menus in your fan pages and pick when to display them: always, or after the page is liked.
* Use the included templates to change the look of your fan page or add your own.
* Up to five pages for your fan page tab.
* Custom header and footer content.
* Add widgets to header, footer or sidebar on demand, per page.
* Select where widgets go in the template.
* 12 page layouts - any combination of header, footer or left/right sidebar.
* Custom CSS
* Easy Open Graph settings per page.
* Filter removal options for header, content and footer - remove unwanted plugins from your fan pages while leaving them active for your site.
* Include Facebook Comments by just enabling comments in our page
* Add Facebook Open Graph tags for easy Facebook integration
* Works with Facebook Timeline
* Backwards compatible with legacy Fanpage Connect pages

To get started, simply install the plugin and follow the instructions on the Settings Page...

= Fanpage Connect Basics =
[youtube https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YT0-4CdmKho]

== Installation ==

1. Upload `fanpage-connect` directory to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory
2. Activate the plugin through the `Plugins` menu in WordPress.
3. Use any of the following shortcodes in your posts or pages:
   Available Shortcodes:

	 **[fbliked]**Content viewable when the page is "liked" goes here**[/fbliked]**

	 **[fbnotliked]**Content viewable when the page has NOT been "liked" goes here**[/fbnotliked]**

	 **[fbadmin]**Content viewable only to page admins goes here.**[/fbadmin]**

	 **[font]**Use any of 150+ Google Web Fonts in your pages!**[/font]**

== Frequently Asked Questions ==

= Is This Plugin Supported? =
Absolutely! Visit <a href="http://www.fanpageconnect.com" target="_blank">www.fanpageconnect.com</a> for support and tutorial videos, or visit our fan page at <a href="http://www.facebook.com/FanpageConnect" target="_blank">http://fb.me/FanpageConnect</a>. You can also join our <a href="http://www.facebook.com/groups/FanpageConnectMastermind/" target="_blank">Fanpage Connect Mastermind Group</a>  on Facebook for tips and tricks on maximizing your social media presence.

= Will this plugin work with my theme? =
Fanpage Connect works with ANY theme. It uses it's own templating system to fit properly into the Facebook iFrame format.

= Will this plugin work with BuddyPress? =
Meh, yes and no. We&#146;ve had reports that it does look odd and behaves strangely in BuddyPress.

= Can I put my entire site into my fan page? =
NO. And why would you?! Your website is your website, and your fan page is just that, your fan page. Fanpage Connect formats individual pages for your fan page tab.

= Can I customize the look and feel of the pages? =
Yes! There are options for custom css files, inline css, and of course, templates. We`ll be offering many custom templates in the near future.

= Can I use video, or opt-in forms, or slide shows, or other cool stuff in my pages? =
Abso-friggin-lutely! Fanpage Connect is the missing link between Facebook and your WordPress page, so you can leverage ANY plugin (free or paid) on your pages - contact forms, video players, calendars; the possibilities are literally endless!

= Could this plugin get any more awesomer? =
Of course it can - we&#146;re actively developing the plugin, so the next version will most likely have at least 65% more awesome - if that's even possible. We&#146;ve also got a premium version. More info is at <a href="http://www.fanpageconnect.com/" target="_blank">www.fanpageconnect.com</a>.

= I installed the plugin, but my site doesn&#146;t look any different in Facebook! =
We&#146;ve got some cool, step by step videos on our fan page, so pop on over to <a href="http://fb.me/FanpageConenct" target="_blank">http://fb.me/FanpageConenct</a> to get the 411 on creating rockin&#146; fan pages!

